  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I have a friend that has opted to creating a VR chat group, has set the admin roles to require 2FA, and wanted me to be an admin.\n\nBut with Authentication Apps being the only option to verify logins, that kinda bars me from turning it on due to an incident I had one time where my previous phone bricked on me, causing me to lose all my keys as they were not cloud protected and only localized on the device. \n\nI think many would benefit from multiple 2FA options rather than just one and only one.",
